        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Analyzes: seasonal sales vs. plan by category, SKU, store, region; sell-through rate; markdown rate; gross margin; identifies best and worst performing seasonal items
Responsible (R): Analytics Manager
Accountable (A): Category Manager
Duration: 3–5 days/season</bpmn:documentation>
