      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Post-season financial close
Frequency: 6/year; 13 categories
Volume: 6 reports/year
Owner: FP&amp;A Analyst
Participants: FP&amp;A Analyst, Finance Mgr, Category Mgrs, VP Merch
Source: workflow W2404 — Seasonal Category Profitability Report</bpmn:documentation>
