        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Calculates: seasonal category P&amp;L (revenue, COGS, markdowns, vendor allowances, net margin); compares vs. plan and vs. prior year same season; identifies most/least profitable seasonal categories
Responsible (R): FP&amp;A Analyst
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 3–5 days/season</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2404_Flow8</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2404_Flow9</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
